|~ What is declared under `::group`, the steps in parentheses run on
   the value in the pipe: its refusals. ~|

:group/construct
  |~~ The step `(pipeline)` from the quote of its pipeline. ~~|
  ::builtin{}

:group/PayloadNotQuoteError
  |~~ The payload of `::group` is the quote of its pipeline.

      ~(
        42 | tag ::group
        !| [type /actualType]
        |  eq [::group/PayloadNotQuoteError ::number]
       )
  ~~|

:group/ReadBackDiffersError
  |~~ The `::group` prints as text that reads back as another step, or
      as none: a group holds at least one step.

      ~(
        ~() | tag ::group
        !| [type /printed]
        |  eq [::group/ReadBackDiffersError "()"]
       )
  ~~|

:group/ReadBackDiffersError/printed
  |~~ The text the step prints as, which reads back as another step or as none. ~~|
  ::string
